# MGCLex4j
This is a Lexer Generator, similar to mgclex though this is intended to be used
as a dependncy injected java library instead of mgclex's static C header file output.

## Any Other Differences From mgclex?
The choice of algorithm. while the C based generator uses the Aho, Sethi, Ullman Direct DFA construction
this version uses the traditional Thompsons Construction NFA -> DFA route.